{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"The retained run reproduces the context mismatch. Follower 2 submitted `(1001,31)` but received `(2002,32)`, follower 3’s context. Both control replies preserved their inputs. The trace also shows that the leader removed the earlier request from its pending queue.\n\nI’ll record this as a supported local interface violation. The run did not measure a client timeout or a stale FSM read.\n"}}
